\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, Friend of little children,
\par Be a friend to me;
\par Take my hand and ever keep me 
\par Close to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Teach me how to grow in goodness
\par Daily as I grow;
\par Thou hast been a child and surely
\par Thou dost know.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Step by step, O lead me onward,
\par Upward into youth;
\par Wiser, stronger, still becoming
\par In Thy truth.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Never leave me or forsake me,
\par Ever be my friend,
\par For I need Thee from life's dawning
\par To its end.  
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

